<h1>Quotas &amp; billing <span class='chip chip--primary'>v2</span></h1>
<p>Godzilla enforces resource quotas per workspace according to your plan tier. This page details plan limits, quota dimensions, and the exact platform behavior when an account exceeds its quota.</p>

<div class='stat-card'>
  <div class='stat-card__value'>1,000</div>
  <div class='stat-card__label'>requests / minute (Standard Tier)</div>
  <p class='stat-card__description'>Default API rate limit per workspace. Enterprise plans support customized limits up to 50,000+ req/min.</p>
</div>

<h2 id="plan-tiers">Plan tiers</h2>
<p>Each workspace is subscribed to one of three tiers. Quotas apply across all pipelines, connectors, and API keys created within that workspace.</p>

<table class='param-table'>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>
